    "descs": [
     {
      "lang": "da",
      "subject": "Meddelelse til alle tankskibe",
      "details": "<p>Fra og med 24. februar 2025 vil de danske myndigheder anr&aring;be&nbsp;tankskibe med en dybgang p&aring; over 11m, der formodes at transportere olie som last og som vurderes at ville sejle gennem Storeb&aelig;lt. Skibene vil blive anmodet om frivilligt at indsende deres Civil Liability Convention (CLC) certifikat d&aelig;kkende olieforureningsskader. En digital kopi af CLC kan sendes til:&nbsp;<a href=\"mailto:contact@example.com\">contact@example.com</a>.</p>"
     },
     {
      "lang": "en",
      "subject": "Notice to all tanker vessels",
      "details": "<p>As of 24 February 2025, the Danish Authorities will hail tankers with a draft exceeding 11m,&nbsp;which are presumed to be carrying oil as cargo and are assessed to pass through the Great Belt, kindly requesting them to voluntarily submit their Civil Liability Convention (CLC) Certificates of Insurance for oil pollution damage.&nbsp;A digital copy of the CLC can be sent to:&nbsp;<a href=\"mailto:contact@example.com\">contact@example.com</a>.</p>"
     }
    ],
    "hideSubject": true
   }
  ],
