    "descs": [
     {
      "lang": "da",
      "subject": "Tunnel etableres. Afmærkede forbudsområder",
      "details": "<p><strong>Indtil videre</strong> etableres en tunnel mellem Femern og Lolland, i omr&aring;det afgr&aelig;nset af en linje gennem position 1) - 4).&nbsp;</p>\n<table class=\"position-table\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pos-index\">1)</td>\n<td class=\"pos-col\">54&deg; 38,433'N - 011&deg; 22,183'E</td>\n<td>kyst</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pos-index\">2)</td>\n<td class=\"pos-col\">54&deg; 38,683'N - 011&deg; 21,317'E</td>\n<td>kyst</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pos-index\">3)</td>\n<td class=\"pos-col\">54&deg; 30,217'N - 011&deg; 14,033'E</td>\n<td>kyst</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pos-index\">4)</td>\n<td class=\"pos-col\">54&deg; 29,517'N - 011&deg; 14,600'E</td>\n<td>kyst</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>Indenfor omr&aring;det er der oprettet to afm&aelig;rkede forbudsomr&aring;der. Omr&aring;derne flyttes l&oslash;bende som n&oslash;dvendigt.&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Inden for de afm&aelig;rkede omr&aring;der anvendes ankerb&oslash;jer med gul lysafm&aelig;rkning.</strong></p>\n<p>Se i &oslash;vrigt vedh&aelig;ftede meddelelse NM-270-22.</p>"
     },
     {
      "lang": "en",
      "subject": "Tunnel being established. Buoyed prohibited areas.",
      "details": "<p><strong>Until further notice</strong>, a tunnel is being established between Femern and Lolland, in the area bounded by a line through positions 1) - 4).&nbsp;</p>\n<table class=\"position-table\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pos-index\">1)</td>\n<td class=\"pos-col\">54&deg; 38.433'N - 011&deg; 22.183'E</td>\n<td>coast</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pos-index\">2)</td>\n<td class=\"pos-col\">54&deg; 38.683'N - 011&deg; 21.317'E</td>\n<td>coast</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pos-index\">3)</td>\n<td class=\"pos-col\">54&deg; 30.217'N - 011&deg; 14.033'E</td>\n<td>coast</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pos-index\">4)</td>\n<td class=\"pos-col\">54&deg; 29.517'N - 011&deg; 14.600'E</td>\n<td>coast</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>Two buoyed prohibited aread are established within the area.</p>\n<p>The areas are being moved continuosly as required.&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Within the buoyed areas anchor buoys with yellow lights will be used</strong>.</p>\n<p>For further information, see attached message NM-270-22.</p>"
     }
    ],
    "hideSubject": true
