      "lang": "da",
      "subject": "Mindre dybder. Afmærkning udlagt.",
      "details": "<p><strong>Indtil videre,</strong> er der observeret dybder ned til 1,5 m mellem den ydre b&oslash;lgebryder og stenmolen. Omr&aring;det er afm&aelig;rket som anf&oslash;rt p&aring; position 1) - 2).</p>\n<table class=\"position-table\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pos-index\">1)</td>\n<td class=\"pos-col\">54&deg; 57,131'N - 012&deg; 27,749'E</td>\n<td>gul stage med krydstopbetegnelse</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pos-index\">2)</td>\n<td class=\"pos-col\">54&deg; 57,139'N - 012&deg; 27,797'E</td>\n<td>gul stage med krydstopbetegnelse</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>"
     },
     {
      "lang": "en",
      "subject": "Reduced depths. Buoyage deployed.",
      "details": "<p><strong>Until further notice,</strong> depths down to 1.5m have been observed between the breakwater and the stone pier. The area is buoyed as stated in positions 1) - 2).</p>\n<table class=\"position-table\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pos-index\">1)</td>\n<td class=\"pos-col\">54&deg; 57.131'N - 012&deg; 27.749'E</td>\n<td>yellow spar buoy with cross topmark</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pos-index\">2)</td>\n<td class=\"pos-col\">54&deg; 57.139'N - 012&deg; 27.797'E</td>\n<td>yellow spar buoy with cross topmark</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>"
     }
