    "descs": [
     {
      "lang": "da",
      "subject": "Søopmåling",
      "details": "<p><strong>Indtil 16. oktober 2026</strong>, udf&oslash;res der s&oslash;opm&aring;ling i et omr&aring;de afgr&aelig;nset af en linje gennem position 1) - 11).</p>\n<table class=\"position-table\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pos-index\">1)</td>\n<td class=\"pos-col\">54&deg; 56,327'N - 013&deg; 03,781'E</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pos-index\">2)</td>\n<td class=\"pos-col\">54&deg; 58,295'N - 012&deg; 58,870'E</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pos-index\">3)</td>\n<td class=\"pos-col\">55&deg; 03,171'N - 012&deg; 54,124'E</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pos-index\">4)</td>\n<td class=\"pos-col\">55&deg; 01,320'N - 012&deg; 50,894'E</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pos-index\">5)</td>\n<td class=\"pos-col\">55&deg; 03,983'N - 012&deg; 50,235'E</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pos-index\">6)</td>\n<td class=\"pos-col\">55&deg; 08,018'N - 012&deg; 37,019'E</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pos-index\">7)</td>\n<td class=\"pos-col\">55&deg; 14,190'N - 012&deg; 21,429'E</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pos-index\">8)</td>\n<td class=\"pos-col\">55&deg; 14,885'N - 012&deg; 21,726'E</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pos-index\">9)</td>\n<td class=\"pos-col\">55&deg; 04,454'N - 012&deg; 51,652'E</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pos-index\">10)</td>\n<td class=\"pos-col\">55&deg; 03,813'N - 012&deg; 56,563'E</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pos-index\">11)</td>\n<td class=\"pos-col\">54&deg; 57,027'N - 013&deg; 04,704'E</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>Unders&oslash;gelserne udf&oslash;res fra fart&oslash;jerne&nbsp;&raquo;GEO SURVEYOR V&laquo; (2DPL6) og &raquo;GEO SURVEYOR XI&laquo; (2GRS3), som&nbsp;begge kan kontaktes p&aring; VHF kanal 16 og 8.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Skibsfarten anmodes om at vise hensyn ved passage.</p>"
     },
     {
      "lang": "en",
      "subject": "Hydrographic surveys",
      "details": "<p><strong>Until 16 October 2026</strong>,&nbsp;hydrographic surveys are being carried out in an area bounded by a line through positions 1) - 11).&nbsp;</p>\n<table class=\"position-table\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pos-index\">1)</td>\n<td class=\"pos-col\">54&deg; 56.327'N - 013&deg; 03.781'E</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pos-index\">2)</td>\n<td class=\"pos-col\">54&deg; 58.295'N - 012&deg; 58.870'E</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pos-index\">3)</td>\n<td class=\"pos-col\">55&deg; 03.171'N - 012&deg; 54.124'E</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pos-index\">4)</td>\n<td class=\"pos-col\">55&deg; 01.320'N - 012&deg; 50.894'E</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pos-index\">5)</td>\n<td class=\"pos-col\">55&deg; 03.983'N - 012&deg; 50.235'E</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pos-index\">6)</td>\n<td class=\"pos-col\">55&deg; 08.018'N - 012&deg; 37.019'E</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pos-index\">7)</td>\n<td class=\"pos-col\">55&deg; 14.190'N - 012&deg; 21.429'E</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pos-index\">8)</td>\n<td class=\"pos-col\">55&deg; 14.885'N - 012&deg; 21.726'E</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pos-index\">9)</td>\n<td class=\"pos-col\">55&deg; 04.454'N - 012&deg; 51.652'E</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pos-index\">10)</td>\n<td class=\"pos-col\">55&deg; 03.813'N - 012&deg; 56.563'E</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pos-index\">11)</td>\n<td class=\"pos-col\">54&deg; 57.027'N - 013&deg; 04.704'E</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>The surveys&nbsp;are carried out from the vessels&nbsp;&raquo;GEO SURVEYOR V&laquo; (2DPL6) and &raquo;GEO SURVEYOR XI&laquo; (2GRS3),&nbsp;which can both be contacted on VHF channel 16 and 8.</p>\n<p>Mariners are requested to pass with caution.</p>"
     }
