      "subject": "Båke ændret. Rettelse",
      "details": "<p>B&aring;ken p&aring; den n&aelig;vnte justerede position er blevet &aelig;ndret til en b&aring;ke med fyr, som anf&oslash;rt.</p>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>B&aring;ke nr.</td>\n<td>209</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Fyrliste nr.</td>\n<td>7140</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Position</td>\n<td>60&deg; 42,623'N - 046&deg; 29,332'W</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Navn</td>\n<td>Kingigtoq</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Fyrkarakter</td>\n<td><strong>Fl.G.3s</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Lysevne</td>\n<td>2 sm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Udseende</td>\n<td>Gul p&aelig;l med sorte tal og en r&oslash;d trekant med spidsen opad</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p></p>"
     },
     {
      "lang": "en",
      "subject": "Beacon changed. Correction",
      "details": "<p>The beacon in the mentioned adjusted position has been changed to a lighted beacon, as stated.</p>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Beacon no.</td>\n<td>209</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Light no.</td>\n<td>7140</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Position</td>\n<td>60&deg; 42.623'N - 046&deg; 29.332'W</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Name</td>\n<td>Kingigtoq</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span>Characteristic</span></td>\n<td><strong>Fl.G.3s</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span>Range</span></td>\n<td>2nm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span>Structure</span></td>\n<td>Yellow pole with black numbers and a red triangle pointing upwards</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>"
